      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "对方不知道是不是在防备我们的攻击，\n一直以固定频率扔出雪球，\n避免我们靠近他们的阵地。",
      "source_fingerprint": "81d5ff28569e3e807f235b3be96f7ef0ee120e3377269511bb0e3517c69188d9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
